        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports recurrent light-headedness and feeling unwell in warm conditions or when standing for a long time, with near-blackouts but no full loss of consciousness. Symptoms have worsened over the last month, including in malls, hot showers, queues, and after sitting upright for a while. Relieved by lying down. Reports longstanding low blood pressure on standing."
      }
